s. 3/ Includes partnerships and personal trust accounts. 4/ Exclusive of banks and insurance companies.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [769, 1888, 1470, 2046], \"page_id\": 83}], \"content\": \"5/ Consists of the investments of foreign balances and international accounts in the United States.\\n6/ Consists of savings and loan associations, nonprofit institutions, corporate pension trust funds, and dealers and broker. Also included are certain government deposit accounts and government-sponsored agencies.\\np Preliminary.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [80, 53, 114, 77], \"page_id\": 84}], \"content\": \"72\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1262, 45, 1572, 89], \"page_id\": 84}], \"content\": \"Treasury Bulletin\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [417, 103, 1184, 132], \"page_id\": 84}], \"content\": \"TREASURY SURVEY OF OWNERSHIP, MARCH 31, 1970\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [76, 223, 799, 541], \"page_id\": 84}], \"content\": \"The monthly Treasury Survey of Ownership covers securities issued by the United States Government, Federal agencies, Federally-sponsored agencies, and the District of Columbia. The banks and insurance companies included in the Survey currently account for about 90 percent of all such securities held by these institutions. The similar proportion for corporations and for savings and loan associations is 50 percent, and for State and local governments, 70 percent. Data were first published for banks and insurance companies in the May 1941 Treasury\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [848, 218, 1567, 321], \"page_id\": 84}], \"content\": \"ury Bulletin, for corporations and savings and loan associations in the September 1960 B