tgage Association Charter Act (12 U.S.C. 1717(c)) during the fiscal year 1968 and outstanding at any time shall be added to the amount otherwise taken into account in determining whether the requirements of the above provisions are met.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [494, 482, 1115, 521], \"page_id\": 38}], \"content\": \"Part A. - Status Under Limitation May 31, 1970\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [685, 523, 935, 555], \"page_id\": 38}], \"content\": \"(In millions of dollars)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [241, 562, 1443, 780], \"page_id\": 38}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>The statutory debt limit established by the Second Liberty Bond Act, as amended (31 U.S.C. 757b)</td><td>377,000</td></tr><tr><td>Amounts outstanding subject to statutory debt limitation:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>U.S. Government securities issued under the Second Liberty Bond Act, as amended</td><td>370,456</td></tr><tr><td>Debt of U.S. Government agencies</td><td>539</td></tr><tr><td>Participation certificates (12 U.S.C. 1717(c))</td><td>2,600</td></tr><tr><td>Total amount outstanding subject to statutory debt limitation</td><td>373,595</td></tr><tr><td>Balance issuable under limitation</td><td>3,405</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [417, 819, 1174, 855], \"page_id\": 38}], \"content\": \"Part B. - Application of Statutory Limitation May 31, 1970\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [683, 860, 936, 889], \"page_id\": 38}], \"content\": \"(In millions of dollars)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [244, 897, 1462, 2096], \"page_id\": 38}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>Classification</th><th>Total outstanding</th></tr><tr><td>Public debt:</td><td></td></tr><tr><